 "emoji": "🔥",
 "sentences": [
  "Wildfires can actually create their own thunderstorms.",
  "These monster clouds are called pyrocumulonimbus.",
  "They rocket smoke 50000 feet into the stratosphere.",
  "NASA's INSPYRE campaign chased these elusive clouds across western North America.",
  "Special jets flew right through the smoke to collect data.",
  "The research helps predict dangerous winds to keep firefighters safe."
